  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Change of use from a house (C3) into a residential care home (Use Class C2)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed development would result in the loss of a single family dwellinghouse and would fail to demonstrate that it would meet identified local need. The application is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies SC1 and SC8.",
    "Reason : 2 - In the absence of a legal agreement, the development fails to secure a nomination agreement agreed with the Council to maximise the utilisation for local residents, and to ensure against the importation of need from outside the Borough, and any necessary monitoring fees and planning services fees. The development would therefore be contrary to adopted Local Plan Policies SC8 and IMP3.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposed development, by reason of the intensification of use, inadequate and unsubstantiated off-street parking provision, lack of information regarding trip generation and servicing, and the absence of safe and suitable pedestrian access arrangements, would result in an unacceptable impact on highway and pedestrian safety. The proposal would likely lead to increase on-street parking pressure, congestion, and conflict between vehicles and pedestrians. The development is therefore contrary to the Council's Residential Crossovers and Off-Street Parking Policy (2016), and Local Plan Policy EC2."
  ],
